<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian storm causes A$100 million damage.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian storm causes A$100 million damage.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Damage from a rain and hail storm that ripped through parts of crop-growing regions of northern New South Wales on Sunday will exceed A$100 million, the Insurance Council of Australia Ltd said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Much of the region's wheat crop is close to harvesting and the storm has devastated many farms across the north-west slopes and ranges,&quot; the council said in a statement.</p>
</text>
